# Ledge: start it with the dummy hanging on the ledge (or save that state to slot 2 and use "start: slot 2").
# The dummy stands, rolls, attacks or jumps from the ledge; hit it as it comes up.
name: Ledge getup
about: Start with the dummy on the ledge. It stands, rolls, attacks or jumps; hit it within 40 frames.
start: here
cpu: none
adapt: ledge
options: stand roll attack jump
weights: 4 4 4 4
react: ledge stand delay 20
trigger: dummy_ledge
success: hit 40
par: 12
timeout: 360
loop: after 45
